          <div class="step-num">1</div>
          <div class="step-line"></div>
        </div>
        <div class="step-body">
          <p class="step-label">Step One</p>
          <p class="step-title">Request a Quote</p>
          <p class="step-desc">Fill out our quick booking form with your event date, location, and a few details. It takes about two minutes. No commitment, no deposit at this stage — just tell us what you're planning and we'll get back to you fast.</p>
          <span class="step-detail">Usually responds within a few hours</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="step">
        <div class="step-number-col">
          <div class="step-num">2</div>
          <div class="step-line"></div>
        </div>
        <div class="step-body">
          <p class="step-label">Step Two</p>
          <p class="step-title">We Confirm &amp; Lock In Your Date</p>
          <p class="step-desc">We'll reach out with a personalized quote based on your event details. Once you're ready to move forward, a 25% deposit secures your date. Dates are first come, first served — so the sooner you book, the better.</p>
          <span class="step-detail">25% deposit to hold your date</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="step">
        <div class="step-number-col">
          <div class="step-num">3</div>
          <div class="step-line"></div>
        </div>
        <div class="step-body">
          <p class="step-label">Step Three</p>
          <p class="step-title">We Arrive Early &amp; Set Up</p>
          <p class="step-desc">On the day of your event, we arrive 45–60 minutes early and handle the entire setup — projector, screen, launch monitor, hitting mat, clubs, balls, and software. You don't touch a thing. By the time your guests arrive, everything is ready to go.</p>
          <span class="step-detail">45–60 min setup — you do nothing</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="step">
        <div class="step-number-col">
          <div class="step-num">4</div>
          <div class="step-line"></div>
        </div>
        <div class="step-body">
          <p class="step-label">Step Four</p>
          <p class="step-title">Your Guests Play — We Run It</p>
          <p class="step-desc">Our attendant runs the experience start to finish. Up to 8 players at a time can compete on 2,300+ world courses, challenge each other in long drive and closest to the pin contests, or try arcade mini games. Beginners and scratch golfers alike love it — no experience needed.</p>
          <span class="step-detail">Up to 8 players — all skill levels welcome</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="step">
        <div class="step-number-col">
          <div class="step-num">5</div>
          <div class="step-line"></div>
        </div>
        <div class="step-body">
          <p class="step-label">Step Five</p>
          <p class="step-title">We Break Down &amp; Disappear</p>
          <p class="step-desc">When the fun is over, we pack up everything in about 30 minutes and leave your space exactly as we found it. No cleanup, no hassle, no leftover equipment. Just great memories — and probably a lot of requests to book us again.</p>
          <span class="step-detail">~30 min breakdown — no cleanup for you</span>
        </div>
      </div>

