<!-- QUICK FAQ -->
<section id="quick-faq" class="section">
  <div class="section-wrap">
    <p class="section-label" style="justify-content:center;">Quick Answers</p>
    <h2 class="section-heading" style="text-align:center;">Common Questions</h2>
    <p style="text-align:center; font-family:var(--font); font-size:1rem; color:var(--muted); letter-spacing:0.06em; margin-bottom:52px;">Everything you need to know before you book.</p>
    <div class="qfaq-grid">

      <div class="qfaq-item">
        <p class="qfaq-q">How much space do you need?</p>
        <p class="qfaq-a">Our inflatable enclosure needs about 20×20 ft with 11 ft of ceiling height. Our compact indoor setup fits in just 15×10 ft with 9 ft ceilings. Both deliver the same full experience.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="qfaq-item">
        <p class="qfaq-q">Do you need power on site?</p>
        <p class="qfaq-a">Yes — we need access to a standard power outlet. We handle all cabling and setup so you don't have to worry about a thing.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="qfaq-item">
        <p class="qfaq-q">How far in advance should I book?</p>
        <p class="qfaq-a">We recommend 3–4 weeks minimum to ensure your date is available. Ideally 8–12 weeks out is best — dates are first come, first served.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="qfaq-item">
        <p class="qfaq-q">Can total beginners play?</p>
        <p class="qfaq-a">Absolutely. The simulator works for all skill levels — we've had guests who've never picked up a club having just as much fun as scratch golfers.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="qfaq-item">
        <p class="qfaq-q">What's the deposit policy?</p>
        <p class="qfaq-a">We require a 25% deposit to secure your date. The remaining balance is due the day of the event. We accept Zelle, check, and card.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="qfaq-item">
        <p class="qfaq-q">What areas do you serve?</p>
        <p class="qfaq-a">We're based in Orland Park and serve 100+ communities across Chicagoland. A $50 travel fee applies to events more than 25 miles from Orland Park.</p>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>

